<h3>Professional profile</h3>
<p>Software developer at Pay Advantage building payment systems with C#, .NET, TypeScript, and Vue. Research background in applied machine learning and mathematical modelling; previously headed a postgraduate design-computation programme and founded the Experimental Maths Lab.</p>

<h3>Technical skills</h3>
<p>Software: C#, .NET, TypeScript, Vue, REST APIs, SQL, Git, and Azure DevOps.</p>
<p>Machine learning and modelling: Python, scikit-learn, computer vision, time-series and generative modelling, statistical inference, and nonlinear optimisation.</p>

