<h3>Selected projects</h3>
<p><strong>AATP: agricultural traceability demonstrator</strong>. Led development and built the complete software demonstrator during my master’s at Griffith University, supervised by the team at Anonyome Labs. Used VON Network, ACA-Py and Python/Flask to integrate digital identity wallets, credential schemas and a web interface for issuing verifiable credentials and tracing products through production, packaging and transport.</p>
<p><strong><a href="https://doi.org/10.1177/20414196241281069">Machine learning for auxetic deformation</a></strong>. Co-developed a workflow combining finite-element simulation data, K-means image labelling and logistic regression to automate deformation-mode detection in re-entrant honeycomb structures. The study detected four of six modes; published in <em>International Journal of Protective Structures</em> (2025).</p>
<p><strong><a href="https://doi.org/10.1142/S0218348X26400633">Heavy-transport decarbonisation modelling</a></strong>. Co-developed a nonlinear framework linking Australian emissions accounting with fleet-transition economics. Evaluated lifecycle emissions, ownership costs and return on investment across 270 scenarios over a 25-year horizon; published in <em>Fractals</em> (2026).</p>

